abstract: "A collection of AI agents and skills developed by the University of Washington Scientific Software Engineering Center (SSEC) and its community. These tools cover a wide range of tasks, including code generation and review, security, containerization, and orchestration. Community contributions include various AI models and workflows that aid in varied scientific applications. The agents are designed to assist researchers and developers in improving their software development practices and productivity."
